; heterogeneous.scm (future work) as basic blocks: 42 is stored in a vector and read back. The
; primitives ##vector-set! and ##vector-ref skip the checks of vector-set! and vector-ref (vector?,
; fixnum? and both bounds), which would hide the point: the value read back has type any.
function main()
A:  v = make-vector(1, 0)
    s = ##vector-set!(v, 0, 42)
    goto B
B:  x = ##vector-ref(v, 0)
    goto C
C:  return x
